# Card and snapshot (overview v3.1)

The profile is a **portable business card**, not a resume dump.

## Business card

Name + verified tick, title, company · industry, location, circular **verified reputation** badge (5.0 effectively unreachable), privacy-aware contacts, **Rate** + **Add to my List**, in-app link to snapshot. Phone: hidden or **Request phone**.

## Professional snapshot (short entries)

Previous employment, education, skills, languages, licenses, **certifications**, memberships. Scannable in seconds.

## CV

Attached **separately** and supplementary. Never render the full CV as the profile or snapshot body.

## App navigation

Bottom tabs: **Browse** (scan/landing) · **My List** (saved contacts) · **Settings** (own profile and privacy).

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — snapshot is a multi-page CV
<Snapshot>{resumeHtml}</Snapshot>

// ✅ GOOD — short fields; CV is a separate attachment
<Snapshot fields={shortEntries} cvUrl={optionalCv} />
```
